### 2. CINEMA
### ============================================================

### 2.1 Create Cinema - EXPECT 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/cinemas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "regionId": {{regionId}},
  "name": "CineGo HTTP Cinema A {{$timestamp}}",
  "address": "72 Le Thanh Ton, District 1",
  "phone": "02812345678",
  "openingHours": "08:00 - 23:30",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

> {%
client.global.set("cinemaId", String(response.body["data"]["id"]));
client.global.set("cinemaName", String(response.body["data"]["name"]));
%}


### 2.2 Create second Cinema - EXPECT 201
