### Expected intentional errors covered:
### 400 - DTO validation, invalid enum/date JSON, Movie/Showtime business rules
### 404 - invalid FK / missing parent / missing resource/relation
### 409 - duplicates, FK-style delete conflicts, scheduled-Showtime seat lock
### 415 - unsupported Content-Type
###
